DELETE /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}
Delete the environment group with the provided ID, including all environment variables and secret files it contains.
Required: envGroupId (path)

DELETE /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/env-vars/{envVarKey}
Remove a particular environment variable from a particular environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path); envVarKey (path) — The name of the environment variable

DELETE /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/secret-files/{envVarKey}
Remove a particular secret file from a particular environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path) — Filter for resources that belong to an environment group; envVarKey (path) — The name of the secret file

POST /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/services/{serviceId}
Link a particular service to a particular environment group. The linked service will have access to the environment variables and secret files in the group.
Required: envGroupId (path) — Filter for resources that belong to an environment group; serviceId (path) — The ID of the service

GET /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}
Retrieve an environment group by ID.
Required: envGroupId (path) — Filter for resources that belong to an environment group

GET /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/env-vars/{envVarKey}
Retrieve a particular environment variable in a particular environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path) — Filter for resources that belong to an environment group; envVarKey (path) — The name of the environment variable

GET /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/secret-files/{envVarKey}
Retrieve a particular secret file in a particular environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path) — Filter for resources that belong to an environment group; envVarKey (path) — The name of the secret file

DELETE /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/services/{serviceId}
Unlink a particular service from a particular environment group. The service will lose access to the environment variables and secret files in the group.
Required: envGroupId (path); serviceId (path)

PATCH /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}
Update the attributes of an environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path); body (body)

PUT /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/env-vars/{envVarKey}
Add or update a particular environment variable in a particular environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path) — Filter for resources that belong to an environment group; envVarKey (path) — The name of the environment variable; body (body)

PUT /v1/env-groups/{envGroupId}/secret-files/{envVarKey}
Add or update a particular secret file in an particular environment group.
Required: envGroupId (path); envVarKey (path); body (body)
